# Feature List Example

This is an example template for `feature_list.md`. Copy this file to `feature_list.md` and customize.

## Features

- [ ] Feature 1: Description of first feature
- [ ] Feature 2: Description of second feature
- [ ] Feature 3: Description of third feature

## Rules

1. Only modify checkbox status `[ ]` to `[x]` when feature is verified working
2. Never edit or remove feature descriptions
3. Work on one feature at a time
4. Mark complete only after testing confirms functionality
